---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Why roldyblog exists.">
  <article class="about shell">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">About this journal</p>
      <h1>Useful details are worth keeping.</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">
        roldyblog is a personal record of the projects I am working on and a
        place to share the journey.
      </p>
      <p>
        It began with a Synology NAS, evolved with a NUC head, and now focuses
        on making services reliable, learning from mistakes, and documenting
        enough detail for others to follow.
      </p>
      <p>
        Over time, the blog will extend to my other interests, including
        cycling, race analysis, and whatever else rewards a closer look.
      </p>
      <p><a href={withBase("/posts/")}>Start with the latest notes →</a></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
